{"3373400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Recoil Control: The Adventures of Rico Ché", "steam_appid": 3373400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free base game includes the first playable chapter. Future chapters will be released as paid DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Rico Ché, a rising sharpshooter on a mission! In the atmospheric depths of a shadowy city, danger lurks at every turn. Outsmart your adversaries as you unravel the secrets hidden around Hobbe’s Gun Shop. Arm yourself with a variety of weapons to gain the upper hand—but beware, your enemies are more dangerous than they appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Outside Hobbe’s Gun Shop</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most renowned gun store in the city, Hobbe’s Gun Shop serves everyone—from first-time buyers to veteran marksmen perfecting their craft. But beneath its unassuming storefront lies a deeper mystery. Rumored to be a covert training ground, its secrets are yours to uncover—if you can find a way inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From behind the gates of the parking lot, behold the bustling city streets, where random passersby roam and cars cruise through the fog-drenched night, bringing the world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/d6243e3fa107bef71391aecc18c07a36.avif?t=1736281328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras_big/d6243e3fa107bef71391aecc18c07a36.avif?t=1736281328 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Parking Lot Dwellers</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters strolling in Hobbe’s Parking Lot may seem friendly —until you give them a reason not to be. From the casual citizens to the sharp-eyed security guard and the deadly Gunslinger, there’s plenty to deal with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy their quirky lines and bold personalities, but don’t get too close—the Sharpshooter isn’t one to miss.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/b520da228802d92817bdc52699eb6698.avif?t=1736281328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras_big/b520da228802d92817bdc52699eb6698.avif?t=1736281328 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Derelict Gate</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadowy fence stands tall beside Hobbe’s Gun Shop, locked tight and long forgotten by the bustling city around it. Its origins are unclear, but those with ambition and resourcefulness seem to have claimed the area for their own pursuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind the gate? Perhaps the answer isn’t what you expect—but those willing to explore might just uncover the tools they need to make progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/979d165be6e67c8e65f57a8d9e5f72ee.avif?t=1736281328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras_big/979d165be6e67c8e65f57a8d9e5f72ee.avif?t=1736281328 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and dive in—will you uncover the secret behind Hobbe’s Gun Shop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free base game includes the first playable chapter. Future chapters will be released as paid DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Rico Ché, a rising sharpshooter on a mission! In the atmospheric depths of a shadowy city, 