m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras_big/b520da228802d92817bdc52699eb6698.avif?t=1736281328 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Derelict Gate</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadowy fence stands tall beside Hobbe’s Gun Shop, locked tight and long forgotten by the bustling city around it. Its origins are unclear, but those with ambition and resourcefulness seem to have claimed the area for their own pursuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind the gate? Perhaps the answer isn’t what you expect—but those willing to explore might just uncover the tools they need to make progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/979d165be6e67c8e65f57a8d9e5f72ee.avif?t=1736281328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras_big/979d165be6e67c8e65f57a8d9e5f72ee.avif?t=1736281328 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and dive in—will you uncover the secret behind Hobbe’s Gun Shop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A low-poly first-person shooter with challenging combat, realistic bullet-drop physics, and cartoony characters. Navigate a foggy urban lot, solve puzzles to uncover secrets, and face quirky foes with bold personalities. Can you crack the mystery of Hobbe’s Gun Shop?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/header.jpg?t=1736281328", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/7f6eef03c696337dcdb69c63209803b5b1ca7297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736281328", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset